    "Pinned62F541..551 loads record+0 DWORD, stride58 and16slots, selects first nonzero DPID before pending initialization62F560. Current flagged source tests field_8_ instead; sibling plain group tests field_0_. Confirm receiver/table base and original widths independently, then repair the flagged field selection. Preserve original uninitialized pending/retry arrays and null/error/control order. Optional plain sender packet-header direct-store form only if natural and proven; no broad Net rewrite.",
    "User explicitly requests cheap parallel whole-owner recovery. Worker owns isolated edit/test/native-measure loop, one resource_environment(sharedroot/recovery/resources.json,[checkout]) lease per operation, jobs1 per prefix; children inherit without allocating. Absolute sharedpool root .opensmacx/wine, pinned original image and sharedparsecache root .opensmacx/cache/parse. Python uv run; appropriate execution permissions for Wine.",
    "No Git, record, claim/ORIGINAL edits, preparation mid-epoch, framework or sharedroot edits. Preserve all original identity/spans/claims, quirks and useful findings. New outside-owner discoveries require central expansion immediately. Existing native Compiler.overlay/compare_unit/COFF diagnostics, not new public tools. Whole-owner subjects are collateral scope, not claimed new coverage.",
    "At most two natural forms per selected function; stop plateaus and preserve useful candidate/evidence. No unsafe/error normalization, arbitrary bugfix, attributes, flag, volatile, assembly or fake dispatch tricks. Actual-source controls with meaningful mutants where behavior changes; matching does not prove behavior/game/full acceptance. Freeze returned inputs and STOPedits; coordinator reviews and integrates batches."
  ],
